### attack_b_entropy_leakage
Training autoencoder on 177 QRNG windows (window_size=16)...

============================================================
ATTACK B RESULTS: Entropy Leakage via Autoencoder Reconstruction
============================================================
  (Lower error = autoencoder finds MORE structure/patterns = WORSE for security)

  QRNG held-out test error    = 0.07112 (±0.01698)
  Mersenne Twister error      = 0.07270 (±0.01940)
  Pure uniform random error   = 0.07422 (±0.02099)

  QRNG error / Pure-random error ratio = 0.958
  -> QRNG behaves like ideal randomness (ratio ~1.0). GOOD — no obvious leakage.
